From 8be4a2db114910f5fc3cb92d912704b7887ec9cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 22:21:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] GLO WEIGHTS: the shipping engines' nine weights

With MELODEE_FELUCCA_ENGINES (the default), GLO > WEIGHTS sets points
for P5, FM6, DRUM, PHASE / LOFI, VOICE, TRIO, WHEEL / PHYS, BUDGET,
GUARD on three pages; the CZ-1 and SID rows are gone. The device record
(favorites row 8) becomes version 2, nine nibbles; a version 1 record
keeps its P5, FM6 and DRUM. Builds with CZ-1 and SID keep the old pages.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0131vpfZVN4vprBnQkpmn5yn
